From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jens Willmer <info@jwillmer.de>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 17:45:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 02/35] minimize: unit tests for tab counts, ignore file and
 short titles

Split file IO from parsing so the logic can be tested: parse_session
(Firefox session JSON), term_tabs::load_from(dir), parse_ignore,
firefox_tab_title and a free short_title(title, app_name, app_id).

lz4_block now stops as soon as the output would exceed the declared
size, instead of growing the buffer from a corrupt length and failing
only at the end.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BLrpLktNVQBZowKMy1ebh2

